{"title": "Prey Upon the Weak", "pageid": 28114, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Prey_Upon_the_Weak", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Prey Upon the Weak</b> is a passive feature that deals more damage to severely injured targets.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This weapon deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage against targets with 50% of their <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">hit points</a> or fewer. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Mischief\" title=\"Crimson Mischief\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/30px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/45px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/60px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/30px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Mischief\" title=\"Crimson Mischief\">Crimson Mischief</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Murderous_Cut\" title=\"Murderous Cut\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Rusty_Dagger_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Murderous_Cut\" title=\"Murderous Cut\">Murderous Cut</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aicir_Tapol\" title=\"Aicir Tapol\">Aicir Tapol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Barnz\" title=\"Barnz\">Barnz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Blythe\" title=\"Blythe\">Blythe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cirian\" title=\"Cirian\">Cirian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Clotilde\" title=\"Clotilde\">Clotilde</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Deera\" title=\"Deera\">Deera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Derysia\" title=\"Derysia\">Derysia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dhoria\" title=\"Dhoria\">Dhoria</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Edward_Tremby\" title=\"Edward Tremby\">Edward Tremby</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eglantine\" title=\"Eglantine\">Eglantine</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eni\" title=\"Eni\">Eni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Feona\" title=\"Feona\">Feona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Flo-Flo\" title=\"Flo-Flo\">Flo-Flo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fustian\" title=\"Fustian\">Fustian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glyria\" title=\"Glyria\">Glyria</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gruntman\" title=\"Gruntman\">Gruntman</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hiila\" title=\"Hiila\">Hiila</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Liya\" title=\"Liya\">Liya</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/M%27alice\" title=\"M'alice\">M'alice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mitchia\" title=\"Mitchia\">Mitchia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nov_Shmoz\" title=\"Nov Shmoz\">Nov Shmoz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ogga\" title=\"Ogga\">Ogga</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Onilla\" title=\"Onilla\">Onilla</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rycke\" title=\"Rycke\">Rycke</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shrev\" title=\"Shrev\">Shrev</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skoan\" title=\"Skoan\">Skoan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Snirr\" title=\"Snirr\">Snirr</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spaulder\" title=\"Spaulder\">Spaulder</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vagga\" title=\"Vagga\">Vagga</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Varneela\" title=\"Varneela\">Varneela</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Velki\" title=\"Velki\">Velki</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zerillis\" title=\"Zerillis\">Zerillis</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The weapon tooltip incorrectly lists two entries of <em>+<span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></em>, with one also stating <em>(Conditional)</em>.  This is merely a UI bug, and the weapon will correctly deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> additional damage.</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Targets at or below half their HP receive +1d4 piercing damage.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201931\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2105/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21610/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7831/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1807/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 972471/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.019      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   57.019      1 -total\n 34.28%   19.545      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 26.68%   15.213      2 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 25.55%   14.569      3 Template:DamageText\n 24.22%   13.810      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 22.89%   13.050     33 Template:Trim\n 22.44%   12.796      3 Template:Damage_type\n 21.76%   12.406      3 Template:Icon_link\n 21.01%   11.977      3 Template:Icon_text\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28114-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201931 and revision id 373999. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}